---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
	<main class="wrap">
		<h1>About this course</h1>
		<p class="lead">
			A seven-week, single-person course to get Frank gig-ready on bass for a Friday-night reunion show — from memory, in time, and without panic.
		</p>

		<div class="card">
			<h2>The mission</h2>
			<p>Play the full set on <strong>October 9, 2026 at Canyon Lake</strong> — all 7 core songs (plus 2 backups) — through from memory at gig tempo, hitting the signature hooks, and enjoying it.</p>
			<p>A song is <strong>green</strong> when you can play its roots and groove in time from memory, plus the recognizable hooks. Fills are stretch, not required.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="card">
			<h2>How it's built</h2>
			<p>Course content is authored in Markdown/HTML under the hood, then served as a static site via GitHub Pages. The dashboard uses a small bit of client-side script to track your song status and "what to work next" in your own browser — nothing leaves the device.</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
